{"id":"4016506533731047150","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"My Perspective 🖋️\n\nI’ve seen discussions about the safety netting left up during SKZ’s concert in Fukuoka. As a J-STAY, I wanted to share a bit of context!\n\nPayPay Dome is owned by the Fukuoka SoftBank Hawks (Japan's \"NY Yankees\"), who installed a huge 21-meter (69 ft) safety net this year. Venue rules require flawless restoration after events—even a single lost bolt on the field could cause a career-ending injury for a player. Stage teardown normally takes two full days.","username":"junes_insights","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@junes_insights/post/De9f2l9Exbu","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:28:32Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:34.940459872Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:41.118567Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:41.118567Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_2b9503995ab90ece","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4016506535928895641","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"During the 2023 tour, SKZ played on Wed/Thu to allow teardown time before a Saturday game. This time, the show was Saturday, and a critical playoff game was Sunday afternoon.\n\nThe concert ended at 10:30 PM, and baseball doors opened at 4:00 PM the next day. The crew had to finish a 2-day job in just 17 hours, working straight through the night. Leaving the net up was a painful compromise to save crucial time.","username":"junes_insights","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@junes_insights/post/De9f2oAE5iZ","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:28:32Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:34.940467704Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:41.118567Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-26T16:17:41.118567Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_28ec972e60a87582","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
